{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Dawn is a cinematic story-survival game that tells the story of a man who has lost his family and whose eyes awaken alone in a hospital room after a long coma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you go outside, the city is silent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you return home to find your family, everything has been destroyed: no one, no trace\u2026 just a dark silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You search for answers, traversing makeshift campsites, abandoned vehicles, and the wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You scavenge for resources, trying to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every note you find, every sound you hear, brings you one step closer to what happened to your family.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4037950?t=1765398909","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4037950?t=1765398909","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037950/d66a2331bf35b564fc11afe4035356ebe2bd7d7b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765398909","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037950/d66a2331bf35b564fc11afe4035356ebe2bd7d7b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765398909","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains themes of crime, imprisonment and escape. \r\nIt includes tense situations, mild violence, and mature narrative elements that may not be suitable for all ages. \r\nThere is no sexual content or explicit gore.\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Dawn is a cinematic story-survival game that tells the story of a man who has lost his family and whose eyes awaken alone in a hospital room after a long coma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you go outside, the city is silent.</p><p class=\"bb_p